    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbaganikīla basugi ba sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbitana kwibilinga Yelusalemu pye a bataale ba būsugi ū mu Isilaeli; biza a bataale ba magele ga bashilikale shihūmbī-shihūmbī, na ga bashilikale igana-igana abo baalī ū mu būtūmami wa ntemi; na a balang'hani ba sabo na mitugo ja ntemi nī ja bitūnja bakwe. Na a batūmami bataale ba ng'wikūlū, na a bagosha ba mbagashūūla, na a bashilikale a bose abo batogohaga mhayo gose-gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi Daūdi wīmīīla ūbawīla gīkī, “Bing'we badūgū bane na banhū bane, nidegelekagi; ū mu ng'holò yane līkilonga iganiko lya kūzenga numba kūlwa wifuulīlo w'isandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa SEEBA, lībize ipandī lya kūtūūla mhambala kūlwa ng'wa Mulungu wise, nūgolanya nī milonjo ya gīkī nandye ū kūzenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu ūniwīla gīkī, ‘Ū bebe ūtūzenga numba kūlwa lina lyane, nguno ūlī nshilikale, a mining ayo wagiita ha sī mingī no.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī chene ū SEEBA Mulungu wanisola kūfuma ū mu numba ya ng'wise ī yose, gīkī nabize ntemi wa Isilaeli welelo bose. Nguno akansola ū Yuda kūbiza ntongeeji, hanuma ū kūfuma ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda wīsola ī numba ya ng'wise, hūna ū kūfuma mu bitūnja ba ng'wa baba, gūnyeja ū SEEBA gwa kūnīīta ū nene kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū mu bitūnja bane bose (gīt'ūmo mumanīlie gīkī ū SEEBA waninha bitūnja bingī), wansolile ng'witūnja wane Solomoni gīkī igashe a hisumbī lya būtemi wa ng'wa SEEBA ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaniwīla gīkī, ‘Ū ng'witūnja wako ū Solomoni hū ng'wene ūyo akwīzenga ī numba yane, na a mapandī gayo a ga kwibilingīla, nguno ū ng'wenūyo nansolile kūbiza ng'witūnja wane, ū nene nakūbiza Ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūshikīlīja a kahelele kane, nī shilagīlo shane ūshidima mu būtūūlelengeta gīt'ūmo īlī ī mihayo ī haha, ū būtemi bokwe nakūwīta būlame shikū jose ja welelo na welelo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha nalīmukomeleja mu būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose na mu miso ga kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA, nū Mulungu wise. Ilang'hanagi gete mushimīzīle ū mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, hū mukūdūla ū kwikala ū mu sī ī yawiza īyī, na a baana bing'we mukūbalekela ībize wingīji wabo wa welelo na welelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūnganikīla Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe nang'ho ng'wana wane Solomoni, ng'witegelejage gete ū Mulungu wa ng'wa so, ūntūmamīle we na ng'holò yako yose; na a maganiko gako gazunye ū kūntūmamīla. Nguno ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū ngīsīlīja wa ng'holò jose, na a maganiko a gose agamanile nī mbūūkī yago. Ūlū ūnkooba akwilonga ū kūlī bebe, alīyo ūlū ūng'wība akūkūponya ilalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ilang'hanage nguno ū SEEBA wakūsolile kwīzenga ī hekalu, īlo līl'ipandī lyeela; idadīlage ūgwīte ū nīmo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūng'winha ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni plana ya koolekeja ūmo īkūbizīla ī heekalu ūlū yūzengwa: ī libīndo lyayo, ī numba jayo, ī chumba sha kūbīkīla shikolo, ī chumba sha kwigūlya, ī chumba sha mu gatī, na haho līlabize ipandī lyeela no-no-no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha a kahelele ka yose īyo Moyo walī wantūūlīla ū mu maganiko gakwe kūlwa mapandī ga kwibilingīla ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nī chumba ī shingī ī shose shilīmo, nī chumba sha kūtūūlīla sabo ya mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, nī sha kūtūūlīla ī shikolo īsho shikūyūfunyiwa kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha na a kahelele ka ndīīma ja bagabīji na a Balawī; ūnangīīla pyī ī mbika ja katūmamīle ka milīmo ya mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA; nī shiseme ī shose īsho shiigeleellilwe kūtūmamīlwa mu makanza ga kūlamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'helela nū būdito wa zahabu ījo jiigelile kūbeeja pyī ī shikolo sha zahabu īsho shilayūtūmamīlwa mu mbika jose na jose ja milīmo ya kūlamya; nū būdito wa feza ījo jiigelile kūbeeja pyī ī shikolo sha feza īsho shilayūtūmamīlwa mu mbika jose na jose ja milīmo ya kūlamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha nū būdito wa zahabu ījo jiigelile kūbeejiwa makīndīkīlo ga tala a ga zahabu nī tala jago; nū būdito wa būlī ikīndīkīlo lya tala nī tala jalyo. Nū būdito wa feza ījo jiigelile kūbeeja makīndīkīlo ga tala, a ga feza nī tala jago; kūlenganīla na katūmamīle ka būlī ikīndīkīlo lya tala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha nū būdito wa zahabu ījo jikūnaagīlwa ha būlī meza ya kūtūūla migatī myeela; nū būdito wa feza ja kūtūmamīlwa ha meza ja feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha nū būdito wa zahabu ī yawiza no-no-no kūlwa nguno ya kūbeeja uuma, mabbakuli ga kūseeseebelela, na shinje; nū būdito wa zahabu ja kūbeeja būlī isinia lya zahabu, nū būdito wa feza jakūbeeja būlī isinia lya feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'winha nū būdito wa zahabu īyo īmalile kweejiwa kūlwa kūtūūla ha ng'walīlo gwa kūzuukīja būbbani. Ūng'winha nī shiikolanīgījo shaalyo ī lisandīko ūmo līkūbiza ūlū gūtūūlwa hoi a makelubi ga zahabu, ayo gaalile a manana gago kūlīshīkīja ī lisandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūhaya gīkī, “Ī yose yenīyī yandīkile, nguno ū nkono gwa ng'wa SEEBA gwalī hamò naane, ūninha witegeleja ū mu mihayo yose yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni na gīkī, “Idadīlage ūtimbye ng'holò, ūgwīte ū nīmo. Yaya ū kogoha, nūūlū ūtizūgwa ng'holò; nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu, ū Mulungu wane, alī hamò nang'ho. Atīko kūkūlekanīja nūūlū kūkwība, kūshisha gūshile pyī ū nīmo gwa kūbeeja īyo yigeleelilwe kwītwa mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A magele ga bagabīji na a ga Balawī galīho galindanile kwīta ī milīmo ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, na būlī munhū ūyo alī na būdūla ūyo atogilwe kūgunanha akūkūgunanha ū mu nīmo ū gose. A bataale ba būsugi bakūkwigwa mu yose īyo ūlabalagīle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
